{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_16","type":"agent_message","text":"The cavern layout, procedural characters, wildlife, and inked scenery are in place. I’m wiring the playable systems now: buoyant swimming, ladder climbing, steerable balloon travel, shared checkpoints, and the return ride. The menus will expose the same actions on controller, keyboard, and touch, including live balance sliders in the pause menu’s field kit."}}
