{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_27","type":"agent_message","text":"The first automated route found two level-flow problems: an early ledge obstructed the landing area, and the river’s swim boundary ended before the exit steps. I’m correcting both and rerunning the route. WebGPU initializes successfully here, but its headless screenshots are blank as the environment notes warned; I’m using the renderer’s WebGL fallback for visual inspection."}}
